# mode: concurrent
# expect: 7
# §8c regression guard: identical-shape re-add in a suspending proc must
# remain silent. The conservative `sm__walk_locals` walker reaches the
# same name from multiple AST branches (here, both arms of the if write
# to `n`) and dedup is intentional. Only differing storage shapes error.
proc choose [] [
  def fut [spawn [ 0 ]]
  mut n 0
  if [== 1 1] [
    mut n 7
  ] else [
    mut n 99
  ]
  + $n [await $fut]
]
print [choose]
